{
  "schema_version": "1.7.0",
  "id": "USN-8783-1",
  "summary": "openjdk-25 vulnerabilities",
  "details": "Weber Leon discovered that the 2D component of OpenJDK 25 did not\ncorrectly handle user authentication. A remote attacker could possibly\nuse this issue to cause a denial of service. (CVE-2026-70906)\n\nKai Aizen discovered that the Networking component of OpenJDK 25 did not\ncorrectly handle user authentication. A remote attacker could possibly\nuse this issue to leak sensitive information. (CVE-2026-61308)\n\nIt was discovered that the JSSE component of OpenJDK 25 did not correctly\nhandle user authentication. A remote attacker could possibly use this\nissue to cause a denial of service. (CVE-2026-70907)\n\nIt was discovered that the Security component of OpenJDK 25 did not\ncorrectly handle user authentication. A remote attacker could possibly\nuse this issue to leak sensitive information. (CVE-2026-60589)",
